owner decisions carried out, and each one turned out to be larger\nthan the finding that raised it.\n\nD-038 retires the closed /inspection cycle. §280 called it 1,511 lines; that is\nthe three page files. They were entry points to a whole parallel product -- a\nclient-side call to the engine, a browser-side PDF exporter, a device-global\noffline store, a plan-tiered report packager -- and the deletion set, computed\nas a strict fixpoint where a module goes only when every file that imports it\ngoes too, is 101 files and 13,416 lines. No capability the active workflow\nrequires was found in it. Nine product concepts existed only there and are\nrecorded rather than quietly lost: report cover fields, company logo,\nconfidentiality marker, tiered report packages, local PDF export, photo\nannotation, the local inspection store, a 25-component HazLenz reasoning family,\nand post-completion report editing.\n\nThe natural fear about that last one is the opposite","githubCommitOrg":"McKinley18","githubCommitRef":"beta/expert-hazlenz-validated-candidate-2026-09-12","githubCommitRepo":"safety-insite","githubCommitSha":"f1dfce8cf0d135660d36a20302577c6ded4c40be","githubDeployment":"1","githubOrg":"McKinley18","githubRepo":"safety-insite","githubRepoOwnerType":"User","githubCommitRepoId":"1218386365","githubRepoId":"1218386365","githubRepoVisibility":"public","githubHost":"github.com","githubCommitAuthorLogin":"McKinley18","githubCommitVerification":"unverified","repoPushedAt":"1789358440000","branchAlias":"safety-insite-git-beta-expert-hazle-e8b0bf-mckinley18s-projects.vercel.app","lambdaRuntimeStats":"{\"nodejs\":1}","bundler":"turbopack"},"name":"safety-insite","plan":"pro","private":true,"readyState":"READY","readySubstate":"STAGED","target":null,"teamId":"team_cfAC34zFRbIMAzd97zY6Rr3U","type":"LAMBDAS","url":"safety-insite-ficla6cme-mckinley18s-projects.vercel.app","userId":"5KIi5OuVUf1oi8KKl0NLeTY6","withCache":false,"buildingAt":1789358446766,"readyAt":1789358487685,"prev